# NOTE: We DELIBERATELY commit data/raw/ and data/interim/ so a
# reviewer can reproduce the analysis without re-running the
# pipeline. data/raw/qq/topId*/<period>.json is the QQ weekly
# toplist cache (binary JSON, ~28 MB total). data/raw/netease/
# and data/raw/apple_music/ are current-snapshot CSVs (~1 MB).
# data/interim/ is the cleaned/derived CSVs and figures (~33 MB).
# Total ~106 MB, well within GitHub's recommended repo size.